<h2>Help & Guidance</h2>
<p>
    If you're an employee trying to change your password, kindly click on the <strong>“Forgot Password”</strong> option on the login page.
    Enter your registered email, and you'll receive a link to reset your password securely.
</p>

<h3>Other Common Help Topics:</h3>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Cannot log in?</strong> Double-check your email and password. If unsure, use "Forgot Password".</li>
    <li><strong>Need to update your profile?</strong> Go to your dashboard and click “My Profile”.</li>
    <li><strong>Assigned to the wrong ward?</strong> Please contact your supervisor or HR department.</li>
    <li><strong>Room data is missing?</strong> Ensure you're checking the right ward, or report it to IT support.</li>
    <li><strong>Navigation issues?</strong> Use the sidebar menu — if collapsed, click the toggle to expand it.</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Still stuck? Visit our <a href="/Help/Support">Support</a> page or <a href="/Help/FAQ">FAQ</a> section.
</p>

